sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Operator /<br/>Model Owner
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS 1.2+
    participant Reconciler as ModelServiceReconciler<br/>(controller-manager)
    participant Template as Sprig Template<br/>Engine (in-process)
    participant Merge as Mergo Merge<br/>Engine (in-process)

    Note over User,Merge: Flow 1: ModelService Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply ModelService CR<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8sAPI->>Reconciler: Watch event: ModelService created/updated<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET BaseConfig ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: BaseConfig data (YAML)

    Reconciler->>Template: Interpolate templates<br/>({{.ModelServiceName}}, {{.ModelName}}, etc.)
    Template-->>Reconciler: Resolved specs

    Reconciler->>Merge: Merge BaseConfig + ModelService overrides<br/>(container name-match, env name-match,<br/>args prepend, ParentRef/BackendRef merge)
    Merge-->>Reconciler: Merged resource specs

    loop For each child resource (up to 13 types)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: CreateOrUpdate child resource<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token<br/>(Deployment, Service, SA, RoleBinding,<br/>HTTPRoute, InferencePool, InferenceModel, ConfigMap)
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Resource created/updated
    end

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update ModelService/status<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Status updated

    Note over User,Merge: Flow 2: Inference Request Routing (provisioned resources)

    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>(via HTTPRoute)
    participant EPP as EPP Service<br/>(Endpoint Picker)
    participant Prefill as Prefill Deployment
    participant Decode as Decode Deployment
    participant ModelStore as Model Storage<br/>(HF / PVC)

    Client->>GW: Inference request<br/>HTTPS (per Gateway config)
    GW->>EPP: Route via InferencePool<br/>HTTP/gRPC (per BaseConfig)
    EPP->>Prefill: Prefill request<br/>HTTP/gRPC (per BaseConfig)
    Prefill->>ModelStore: Load model artifacts<br/>(hf:// or pvc://)
    ModelStore-->>Prefill: Model data
    Prefill-->>EPP: Prefill result
    EPP->>Decode: Decode request<br/>HTTP/gRPC (per BaseConfig)
    Decode-->>EPP: Decode result
    EPP-->>GW: Inference response
    GW-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,ModelStore: Ports, protocols, and auth for inference<br/>routing depend on BaseConfig and<br/>ModelService user configuration
